{"id":791,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Solgaleo was once known as the Beast That Devours the Sun. Energy in the form of light radiates boundlessly from it."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When light radiates from its body, this Pokémon could almost appear to be the sun. It will dispel any darkness and light up the world."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"In writings from the distant past, it’s called by the name “the beast that devours the sun.”"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Sometimes the result of its opening an Ultra Wormhole is that energy and life-forms from other worlds are called here to this world."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is said to be a male evolution of Cosmog. At the activation of its third eye, it departs for another world."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It is said to live in another world. The intense light it radiates from the surface of its body can make the darkest of nights light up like midday."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Full Metal Body","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents other Pokémon’s moves or Abilities from lowering the Pokémon’s stats."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":789,"name":"Cosmog","condition":null,"children":[{"id":790,"name":"Cosmoem","condition":"Lv. 43","children":[{"id":791,"name":"Solgaleo","condition":"Lv. 53","children":[]},{"id":792,"name":"Lunala","condition":"Lv. 53","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,713],[1,100],[1,232],[1,322],[1,568],[7,442],[14,319],[21,428],[28,430],[35,234],[42,242],[49,368],[56,528],[63,76],[70,394],[77,469],[84,416]],"machine":[97,34,523,347,370,242,38,89,283,203,797,263,126,83,488,53,394,430,411,248,416,360,535,484,270,63,304,334,442,282,113,232,319,800,200,182,244,94,706,473,115,156,46,157,317,184,214,555,76,796,444,164,241,129,36,851,87,85,433,528,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55c-89","name":"